  m_EditorClassIdentifier: HotPatata::HotPatata.SectionContract
  force: 'Two empty-handed players hold the threshold slab; let go, it keeps the
    great herse up four seconds: everyone runs the 26 m, passing on the way; then
    one pass through the arch.'
